  "description": "This trike might be the most fun anyone can have on three wheels. The EZ Tadpole SX has a low center of gravity that handles like a go-cart. The EZ Tadpole SX was designed to introduce new riders to this thrilling world of trike riding without breaking their wallets. With 24 gears, it won't break their legs either. \"Riding a trike is fun and riding the EZ tadpole was no exception,\" said BentRider magazine, a publication devoted to recumbent bicycles. \"At the very least, I view this trike as the quintessential beach/bike path cruiser.\" Updates to the EZ-Tadpole SX include Direct Steering, the new Slotted Seat adjustment system, and rattle-free and infinite-adjust seat struts.",
